OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy       
OL,6,Fthroughout this evening and overnight, 
OL,7,Fand spells of rain will arrive in the  
OL,8,Fearly hours. A cold night, with        
OL,9,Ftemperatures a only touch higher than  
OL,10,Fon Sunday night, but without the risk  
OL,11,Fof frost.                              
OL,13,CTuesday:FA dull, grey day with         
OL,14,Fovercast cloud, misty in places, and   
OL,15,Fthe odd patch of light rain. Breezy    
OL,16,Ftoo, and feeling cold.                 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
